# Battle against Regidrago (the dragon-orb golem): the Regis' tapped code (short, short, long) on a square under
# bare fifths on horns, and a weighty G-minor brass theme in dotted strides. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Regidrago
tempo 156
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.09
reverb 0.3

